{"unit_id":"S3K926__dsh-session-switch#feature-switch-request","repo":"S3K926/dsh-session-switch","commit":"aa0f47d19e684d29033dd7440b23542cd5fd39c7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-switch** 的功能「switch-request」：Host 接收会话切换请求并校验交接内容，创建工作区和新会话，将交接包作为首条用户消息发送。创建失败时返回错误，避免写入指向不存在会话的待接状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:106-168","index.js:237-297"]}
